---
description: Keep WharfBar docs and .agent in sync
alwaysApply: true
globs:
  - "**/*.md"
---

# Documentation

- Human docs: prefer Turkish; keep API names in English
- Before changing behavior/architecture, read matching `docs/` + `.agent/` files first
- Update `.agent/` and `docs/` in the same change when decisions shift
- Do not paste long technical guides into `.cursor/rules` — link to `docs/` instead
- External notes (e.g. Downloads) are not source of truth; fold content into `docs/`
- New major decisions → `docs/decisions/NNN-*.md` ADR
